# Use Unix line endings (LF) in every text file, on every operating system.
#
# The Docker containers run Linux. A shell script with Windows line endings (CRLF)
# fails there with an error such as "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter". Without this file,
# Git for Windows can convert the files of this repository to CRLF when it clones them.
* text=auto eol=lf
